  "interpretation": "Development only. Apply precision >= .95, recall and count accuracy >= .85, both localized without extras >= .80 and angular p95 <= 15 separately per geometry and stage. Do not infer qualification from pooled results. All variations/counts of an episode stay in the same partition. New content and episodes are required after selection.",
  "rendering": "Use the same spherical image-source direct path for every stage, max_order=0 for direct control. Match content, room dimensions, off-center array pose, source reference directions and noise realization across stages. Source distance is 1.5 m; planar sources stay in the array plane. Normalize actual received scored-window levels and SNR. Report measured Schroeder T20 extrapolation and direct/reflected RIR energy ratio separately from target RT60. Uniform absorption and empty shoebox remain approximations.",
  "assets": "48 previously unused LibriSpeech dev-clean utterances from 16 speakers, eight disjoint speakers in each independent block. Neither new block scored before this revision freeze; speakers are disjoint from all previous assets. 12 episodes per content/geometry/block; acoustic variations and counts remain together. Samples are never supplied with truth to candidates.",
